# Vendored Harbour source debugger (from harbour/src/debug, GPL like Harbour).
# Local change in debugger.prg: Quit() (Alt+X) breaks out to the IDE's
# SEQUENCE instead of __Quit(), so exiting the debugger aborts only the
# debugged program and returns to the IDE.
# libhbdebug stays linked for the dbgentry.c VM glue only; the linker pulls
# just that module since the classes are resolved by the vendored sources.
